  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in se\xE7ti\u011Fin \"K\u0131l\u0131\xE7 Prensi\" kart\u0131
    \"ters\" a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131 {{isim}}.\n\nAya\u011F\u0131n\u0131 kayd\u0131rmak,
    sana zarar vermek ya da sende olan baz\u0131 \u015Feyleri almak isteyen biri
    olmu\u015F. Kart\u0131n, senin bu ki\u015Finin ba\u015Flarda ger\xE7ek niyetini
    anlamad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 s\xF6yl\xFCyor. \u0130\u015Fin komik taraf\u0131,
    sana pek bir iyi niyetle yakla\u015Fm\u0131\u015F ve san\u0131r\u0131m sana bir
    \u015Feyler vadetmi\u015F. Verdi\u011Fi s\xF6zleri yerine getirmedi\u011Fini
    g\xF6rd\xFCk\xE7e, hareketlerinde ve konu\u015Fmalar\u0131nda tutars\u0131zl\u0131k
    oldu\u011Funu anlad\u0131k\xE7a, h\u0131zla gard\u0131n\u0131 alm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    \u0130nsanlar\u0131 iyi analiz edebilme yetene\u011Fin, zekan ve uyan\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    sayesinde seni kullanmas\u0131na ya da seninle oynamas\u0131na izin vermemi\u015Fsin.
    \u0130nsanlar\u0131 yarg\u0131lamayan \"a\u015F\u0131r\u0131 iyi niyetli\" taraf\u0131n,
    seni az kals\u0131n ciddi s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131lara s\xFCr\xFCkl\xFCyormu\u015F."
